{"repositoryId":1316058101,"availability":"available","full":"p0nymc1/cee","name":"cee","description":"Deterministic-first execution engine for agent workflows in Go: the LLM extracts at the edge, a deterministic state machine decides. Zero dependencies, no-code JSON plugins, replayable runs.","category":"Developer tools","language":"Go","stars":97,"forks":1,"created":"2026-07-29T11:35:20Z","updated":"2026-08-07T10:57:44Z","license":"Apache-2.0","branch":"main","homepage":"https://p0nymc1.github.io/cee/","topics":["agents","ai-agents","circuit-breaker","dag","deterministic","execution-engine","go","golang","llm","llmops","orchestration","saga","state-machine","workflow-engine","zero-dependency"],"demo":"https://p0nymc1.github.io/cee/playground/","color":"#323057","ink":"#d6caff","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-18T21:03:10.450Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-18T21:03:10.450Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-18T21:03:10.450Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-12T13:37:51.325Z","stars":99,"forks":1},{"at":"2026-10-15T13:02:11.387Z","stars":97,"forks":1},{"at":"2026-10-18T21:03:10.450Z","stars":97,"forks":1}],"technologies":["Go"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["A business-agnostic, deterministic-first execution protocol. A deterministic state machine drives execution; the LLM is an edge tool that turns unstructured input into structured fields and makes no flow decisions. Domains plug in as manifests or Go hooks without changing engine code.","New here? docs/GETTINGSTARTED.md turns a threshold rule into a replayable policy — and shows which past decisions a change would flip — in about ten minutes, no Go. Or try it in the browser: playground."],"features":["Zero external dependencies — core module uses only the Go standard library; go build / go test run offline.","No-code plugins — a JSON manifest plus the standard action library is enough to ship a validated plugin.","Measured, not asserted — every run emits a scorecard; a leaderboard ranks plugins by model calls elimi